{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 11, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "**A Whirlwind Adventure in Japan**\n\nJapan, a land where ancient traditions meet cutting-edge innovation, left me breathless in just seven days. Our journey began in **Tokyo**, where neon lights of Shibuya crossed with serene shrines at Meiji-Jinja. The hum of bullet trains whisked us to **Kyoto**, where cherry blossoms pinked the streets and geisha glided past in Gion. A quiet tea ceremony in a machiya house felt like stepping into a living painting.\n\nNext stop: **Osaka**, for towering Takoyaki stands and the wild energy of Dotonbori. Street food—crispy okonomiyaki, tangy takoyaki—was a feast for all senses. Then, a shock of green: **Nara**, where friendly deer bow for treats and Todai-ji’s Great Buddha looms with solemn grace.\n\nOff the beaten path, **Kanazawa** surprised us with samurai districts and gold-leafed temples. The **Sea of Japan** coast offered rugged beauty, with waves crashing against cliffs at Shirakami-Sanchi.\n\nThe cherry on top? **Hiroshima’s Peace Memorial** and Miyajima’s floating torii gate. The juxtaposition of war’s somber lessons with nature’s quiet magic lingered long after the trip.\n\nJapan is a symphony of contrasts—loud and hushed, old and new. Every bite, sight, and moment felt like a masterpiece. Already dreaming of the next visit.", "logprobs": [{"token": "**", "logprob": -0.06550939381122589}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.27843376994132996}, {"token": " Wh", "logprob": -0.037113383412361145}, {"token": "irl", "logprob": -0.018043426796793938}, {"token": "wind", "logprob": -4.7801782784517854e-05}, {"token": " Adventure", "logprob": -0.8805687427520752}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.09272511303424835}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.005587673280388117}, {"token": "**\n\n", "logprob": -0.10947004705667496}, {"token": "Japan", "logprob": -1.2507734298706055}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -3.83824300765